 "other_limitations": [
  "Depends on temporal consistency of the series; motion artifacts and irregular frame intervals corrupt differencing",
  "Assumes uniform vascular signal change; may miss delayed or pathological flow (stenosis, occlusion, collaterals)",
  "Absolute differencing can amplify background noise and residual structures",
  "Lacks flow-direction awareness (reflux, retrograde filling, turbulence)",
  "Preprocessing and segmentation are separate, not end-to-end trainable"
 ],
